  "limits": [
    "calls taxonomy->taxonomy: URLs to stripe.com (app/(dashboard)/dashboard/billing/page.tsx:57), api.github.com (app/(marketing)/page.tsx:11), www.w3.org (app/(marketing)/page.tsx:206), tx.shadcn.com (config/site.ts:8), twitter.com (config/site.ts:10), github.com (config/site.ts:11) are not read as requests to taxonomy; set origins.taxonomy if that is its host",
